  "newCodeRationale": "Reuse the installed PSR interfaces, core Scope/Clock/Tokenizer/EgressRequest/DecisionReceipt and existing immutable answer contracts/InvocationDispatch. No donor provides this exact bounded PHP single-send chat adapter. New code is a thin host-injected protocol mapping with typed all-content manifest, exact admitted body and finite nullable observations; no donor runtime imported. Nyholm PSR-7 is dev-only for real offline HTTP message/factory fixtures.",
  "sourceGaps": [
    "PSR-18 cannot enforce timeout, DNS pinning, peer/TLS/proxy safety, transfer caps or disabled internal middleware retries. HostHttpPolicy must configure and qualify the injected client or refuse; scripted tests are not production-client qualification.",
    "Host InvocationAuthorization remains responsible for authoritative source/history/lifecycle checks after markSending and supplies current policy binding to CurrentModelEgress. Remote policy can change after its check; no distributed atomicity is claimed."
  ],
  "handoff": "Product-side receipt only; coordinator mirrors to @plan/artifacts/implementation/P4.9-reuse.json. Executor plan mutation is forbidden."
